'''Mecha-Bun''' (レジェンドブンブンΩ, ''Rejendo Bun Bun Ω'', '''Legend Bun Bun Ω''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy introduced in [[Eldritch Forces]], the final stage of [[Stories of Legend]]. It can be unlocked as a [[Mecha-Bun (Special Cat)|Special Cat]] at a guaranteed chance in said stage. It was added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]].

